            "review_title": "Review at Hipster By The Colour - Beer & Snack Bar",
            "review_text": "Trang Tran\n2 contributions\n0\nThe romantic place ♥️\nJan 2020 • Couples\nI was looking for a vintage but not too dull vibe place near Bui Vien street. The Hipster was a perfect match. I was amazed by the decoration to every little details. They offer beer with many famous brands and delicious cocktails. Besides that foods are amazing with great sauces. Definitely come back many times\nWritten January 21, 2020",
